{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2022-05-26 16:30:00', 'title': 'INTERPUBLIC DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, NY, MAY 26, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- INTERPUBLIC GROUP (NYSE: IPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON IPG COMMON STOCK OF $0.29 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 21, 2022, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 6, 2022."}